<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>把规矩写进话里 —— 前提是模型会照做</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 480, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>两年前</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", lineHeight: 1.5}}>三小时调措辞，效果立竿见影。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8}}>模板、few-shot、角色设定各有讲究。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 648, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#0F6E56"}}>现在</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>调不调，差别已经不大了。</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>那套东西没有白学——它变成了默认值，只是不再是你的杠杆。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>〔边界〕措辞的边际收益已经很低——这是 Anthropic 的定性判断，不是量化结论。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>05 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
